; Defining public-hoist-pattern REPLACES pnpm's defaults (*eslint*, *prettier*),
; so restate them alongside the plugin patterns fresh worktree installs need.
public-hoist-pattern[]=*eslint*
public-hoist-pattern[]=*prettier*
public-hoist-pattern[]=*eslint-plugin*
public-hoist-pattern[]=@next/eslint-plugin*
